{"version":1,"key":"card:134","content":{"id":134,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"不带任何参数的 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"git push","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，默认只推送当前分支，这叫做 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"simple","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 方式。此外，还有一种 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"matching","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 方式，会推送所有有对应的远程分支的本地分支。Git 2.0版本之前，默认采用 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"matching","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 方法，现在改为默认采用 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"simple","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 方式。"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"$ git config --global push.default matching\n# 或者\n$ git config --global push.default simple","language":"bash","uuid":"4f87f859-d797-4534-942f-0fe5e1b3b422","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}],"tags":["Git"],"createTime":1689473523420,"updateTime":1743303640394,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1743303640394}}